# Backend API base.
# - Local dev: leave unset. When the app itself runs on localhost, an
#   unset VITE_BACKEND_URL resolves to the local backend
#   (http://localhost:4000) — start it with `cd backend && npm start`.
# - Production (Cloudflare Pages): set VITE_BACKEND_URL to the live
#   backend URL. An unset value on a hosted origin falls back to the
#   hosted backend (https://api.thebhavesh.online), but production
#   builds should set this explicitly, not rely on the fallback.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=
